Given smarty (variable with name same as a sigle tag):
  {if $call.index != ""}
      {$call.index}
  {/if}

Execute (highlighted variable as variable, not as tag):
  AssertEqual 'smartyConditional', SyntaxOf('if', 1)
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf("call", 1)
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf("index", 1)
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf("call", 2)
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf("index", 2)
  AssertEqual 'smartyConditional', SyntaxOf('if', 2)

